<title>LITHUANIA: Yield stable at sale of 106-day Lithuanian paper.</title>
<headline>Yield stable at sale of 106-day Lithuanian paper.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of 106-day Treasury bills was unchanged on Monday, coming in at 14.13 percent, the same as at last week's sale of 104-day paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD (LAST WEEK)   MIN/MAX   ISSUE   BID    SOLD</p>
<p> 106-day    14.13     14.13     13.55/14.50  60   77.863  40.923</p>
<p>The settlement date for today's auction is October 3 and the mature on January 17 next year.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
